        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Quick Observability Links\n- **Traces (Tempo)**: Go to [Explore / Tempo](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22laravel-gravity-app%22%7D%5D%7D) to search traces.\n- **Logs (Loki)**: Go to [Explore / Loki](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22expr%22:%22%7Bservice_name%3D~%5C%22.%2B%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D) to view raw log streams.\n- **Metrics (Prometheus)**: Go to [Explore / Prometheus](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22expr%22:%22up%22%7D%5D%7D).\n- **Generate Test Data**: Visit `http://localhost:8080/otel-test` or run `php artisan telemetry:test`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Getting Started & Quick Links",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Application Metrics (Prometheus)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
